      "text": "AstroDocX is an offline-first health co-pilot for astronauts on long missions. It learns each person's own baseline, spots drift early, and turns every alert into a clear action: <em>Detect, Explain, Act, Log, Sync later</em>. It's a student prototype on synthetic data, and not a medical device.",
