      "text": "For each crew member AstroDocX learns a personal baseline from 11 metrics, using running statistics, and only learns while things look nominal so slow drift isn't learned away. Smoothed z-scores plus cited absolute limits then give Nominal, Watch or Act, usually needing 2 readings in a row. Each alert says what changed, against whose baseline, and links NASA evidence.",
